config | arch: | info: command-line interface to the system

+ common_routes
  + service ROM | label_last: ld.lib.so | + parent
  + service ROM | label_last: init      | + parent
  + service CPU                         | + parent
  + service PD                          | + parent
  + service LOG                         | + parent
  + service Timer                       | + parent

+ option managed

+ start fonts_fs | pkg: fonts_fs
  + route
    + service ROM | label: config | + parent | label: config -> managed/fonts

+ start system_shell | pkg: system_shell
  + route
    + service Gui                                   | + parent | label: focus
    + service File_system | label_prefix: fonts ->  | + child fonts_fs
    + service File_system | label_prefix: target -> | + child default_fs_rw
    + service File_system | label_prefix: config -> | + parent | identity: config
    + service File_system | label_prefix: report -> | + parent | identity: report
    + service Report | label: clipboard             | + parent | label: clipboard
    + service ROM | label: clipboard                | + parent | label: clipboard
    + service ROM | label: vimrc                    | + parent | label: config -> vimrc
    + service ROM | label_last: cached_fs_rom       | + parent | label: cached_fs_rom
    + service RM                                    | + parent

+ start touch_keyboard | pkg: touch_keyboard
  + route
    + service Gui                                  | + parent | label: touch_keyboard
    + service Event                                | + parent | label: global
    + service File_system | label_prefix: fonts -> | + child fonts_fs
-
